---
description: UI copy and structure — minimize guidance text
globs: "**/*.{tsx,jsx,css}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# UI copy

- Prefer clear structure and flow over explanatory copy.
- Minimize helper text, tips, completion criteria, and “please wait / please save first” banners.
- Titles and labels should name the thing; do not restate what the controls already make obvious.
- Disable buttons when needed instead of explaining why in yellow warning text.
- Keep error `note`s short and factual only when an action actually failed.

# Layout

- Card / Modal / AlertDialog footers with action buttons are always right-aligned (`justify-end`). Never leave footer buttons left-aligned by default.
